		"32 pads",
		"Eight macro encoders",
		"Eight track buttons",
		"Master filter",
		"Master volume"
	],
	"notice": "Eight sample tracks default to MIDI channels 1-8. Connect USB MIDI or the 5-pin MIDI ports. Hold Shift and press Save for Setup View to configure channels and independently enable note, CC, program-change and clock transmission/receive. Channel 16 is reserved for project selection. Pad notes and encoder behavior depend on the current view and configuration; this profile supplies setup guidance and an unbound physical surface, with no guessed CC or pad maps. USB port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. Diagrams are original schematics with illustrative positions, not scaled hardware drawings.",
